  "goodToKnow": "Seinerzeit means at that time or back then: Seinerzeit war das normal. It's a slightly old-fashioned or formal synonym of damals, common in Austria and in newspapers. Written as one word. Don't confuse it with alles zu seiner Zeit (everything in its own time), where seiner Zeit is two words. Also, in Austria, seinerzeit can mean in due course."
